img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Drillworm%20Caves\">Drillworm Caves</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32654,32021,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32654, 32021, 15)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Spike\">Lower Spike</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Forsaken%20Mine%2FLost%20Dwarves\">Lost Dwarf</a> version of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Forsaken%20Mine\">Forsaken Mine</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond%20Factory%20Raids\">Oramond Factory Raids</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%204\">Warzone 4</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tDrillworms chase their opponents. They retarget very often.<br/><br/>A drillworm attacks in melee range. A drillworm never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tStay diagonal. Spawns in the vicinity of <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">Earth Elementals</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyverns</a>.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></b>: Stay diagonal always. At 100+ with decent skills these are no problem. Make sure to heal constantly and try to avoid fighting multiples.\n<b>Sorcerers and Druids</b>: Can easily bring them down by running them and using fire-based attacks. Remember not to stay in front of them because their poison beam deals very high damage. A good strategy is to throw <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Wall\">Fire Walls</a> to run them safely and avoid luring more monsters. At 100+ you can run multiples and shoot GFBs at them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Its experience was decreased from 1,100 to 858 with Update 12.31.</li>\n<li>As announced on May 14, 2024, the patch increased experience from 858 to 1,200 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 76,313 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-150</td>\n<td>65.1</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lump of Earth\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loadin